  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Gemini에게 원소 기호, 원소 이름, 원자번호, 원자량 등을 표기하고 특징이나 쓰임을 나타내는 그림을 같이 그려달라고 넣어봤습니다. 그림이 나름 만족스럽게 나와 공유해봅니다. 제가 물리학 전공이라 제가 주로 관심있는 원소부터 만들어봤는데, 시간날때마다 만들어서 주기율표 전체 한번 만들어볼까 생각중입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/647b63e6ae26326b2f283b062e620b196429cac8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/647b63e6ae26326b2f283b062e620b196429cac8\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88a9bebfd64c461c4d50598de55107183f10241a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88a9bebfd64c461c4d50598de55107183f10241a\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68f70fec35d9520d9cf7c6a480e39e62b1d88326\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68f70fec35d9520d9cf7c6a480e39e62b1d88326\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab245040c0c083156baced10c3917dd28b9dfd79\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab245040c0c083156baced10c3917dd28b9dfd79\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3db6f00e3d57abecd6c3aa307271c3caf22a6ed3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3db6f00e3d57abecd6c3aa307271c3caf22a6ed3\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1639f4db7a959330ea312d8e31a541083999991\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1639f4db7a959330ea312d8e31a541083999991\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이렇게 6개 먼저 올려봅니다! 제미나이 마크 있는게 살짝 걸리면서도 이정도면 나름 괜찮긴 하네요.<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
